  - `sql_injection_check`: Passed (Parameterized queries confirmed)
  - `etl_pattern`: Passed (`extract`, `transform`, `load` structures verified)
  - `separation_of_concerns`: Passed (Split into 6 highly modular functions)
  - `type_hints_and_docstrings`: Passed (Fully type-annotated and documented)
